Error [E0104]: label `dy:` doesn't match the parameter `dx` at position 1
  --> tests/ui/method_label_mismatch.jet:14:22
    |
 14 |     _ :: p.translate(dy: 1.0, dx: 2.0)
    |                      ^^
 Why: labels are checked documentation — they must match the parameter name at that position; arguments stay in declaration order
 Fix: write `dx:` instead, or remove the label

